OL,3,GNEWSAShop owners shocked and saddened
OL,4,Aby bus cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FShopkeepers say they are shocked and
OL,7,Fsaddened by a council's decision to cut
OL,8,Fa bus service only a year after it was
OL,9,Flaunched.
OL,11,FCumberland Council will stop
OL,12,Fsubsidising the MD1 service from
OL,13,FMaryport to Dearham, which runs through
OL,14,Fthe centre of Maryport, due to poor
OL,15,Fusage.
OL,17,FThe service was introduced in 2025
OL,18,Fusing part of a #3.5m government pot
OL,19,Fand was supported with a golden ticket
OL,20,Fscheme by local businesses, giving
OL,21,Fpassengers perks such as discounts for
OL,22,Fusing the service.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
