OL,3,GNEWSAShop owners shocked and saddened
OL,4,Aby bus cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner at The Three Frogs clothing
OL,7,Fshop Michelle Mayman said the news was
OL,8,Fa "big disappointment" for the town.
OL,9,FThe council said the decision had been
OL,10,Fmade with a "heavy heart".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
